        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>m_visibility</name>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Holds the visibility (hidden or visible) for an element implementing the interface. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>By default, all editorial elements are visible. However, in an &lt;app&gt;, only one &lt;rdg&gt; is visible at the time. When loading the file, the first &lt;rdg&gt; (or the &lt;lem&gt;) is made visible. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
